name: habit-checker
description: "HP daily habit check-ins via Discord — morning + evening"
triggers:
  - cron: "30 8 * * *"
    timezone: "America/New_York"
    label: morning
  - cron: "0 21 * * *"
    timezone: "America/New_York"
    label: evening
steps:
  - tool: sessions_send
    label: checkin
    input:
      agentId: hp
      message: |
        HABIT CHECK-IN trigger={{trigger.label}}

        Read workspace/hp/habits.json for current streaks.

        IF trigger=morning:
          DM Zeus (Discord user 1024395579742228570):
          "Morning check. Quick 5: workout planned? sleep ok? priorities set?
          water goal? reading today? Reply y/y/y/y/y or skip any."
          Log timestamp of DM in habits.json under pending_responses.

        IF trigger=evening:
          DM Zeus: "Evening wrap. How many habits today? (workout/sleep/phone/water/reading)
          Current streaks: {list from habits.json}.
          Tone rules: streak>7 celebrate briefly, missed 2+ gentle nudge,
          missed 3+ send motivational message + ask if goal needs adjusting.
          No repeat DM if no response — one follow-up max after 2h."

        IF it is Sunday evening: also compute weekly report:
          Completion rate per habit, best/worst day, one pattern observation,
          one suggestion for next week. Append to habits.json weekly_reports.

        Write all updates back to workspace/hp/habits.json.
